# OS junk only.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: .collab/ and *.events.jsonl. Consultation briefs,
# replies, raw event streams and the sessions.json ledger are meant to be
# committed next to the code they were about - that is the point of this tool.

.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~

# Bridge runtime files inside a task directory. .consult.lock and .consult.write.lock
# are permanent, informational lock files (never delete them); .consult.pending.json
# and a panel member's .consult.pending-<NN>.json exist only during or after an
# interrupted consultation. None of them belongs in history.
.consult.lock
.consult.write.lock
.consult.pending.json
.consult.pending-*.json

# Local eval runs (claude plugin eval) - reports and transcripts, never committed.
evals/results/
